{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/Su1eyman11/status/2098280620720042353","id":"2098280620720042353","text":"Built a DJ setup for G1 with Astra lol\n\nAstra generated most of the scene and interaction logic. Right now the robot is running scripted IK, so the motions are still pretty handcrafted.\n\nNext I want to replace that with a learned policy built on top of a GPC motion prior. Give it the interaction objective and let the policy figure out the actual whole body motion instead of scripting every reach.\n\nDJ policy incoming","raw_text":{"text":"Built a DJ setup for G1 with Astra lol\n\nAstra generated most of the scene and interaction logic. Right now the robot is running scripted IK, so the motions are still pretty handcrafted.\n\nNext I want to replace that with a learned policy built on top of a GPC motion prior. Give it the interaction objective and let the policy figure out the actual whole body motion instead of scripting every reach.\n\nDJ policy incoming","display_text_range":[0,419],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[281,304],"id":"2098280037200138240","display":"pic.x.com/L3gcakGJak","original":"https://t.co/L3gcakGJak","replacement":"https://x.com/Su1eyman11/status/2098280620720042353/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Su1eyman11","url":"https://x.com/Su1eyman11","id":"822459120880091136","followers":131,"following":109,"likes":132,"media_count":11,"name":"Suleiman","description":"robot learning, physical intelligence, questionable experiments\nbuilding @daionics","raw_description":{"text":"robot learning, physical intelligence, questionable experiments\nbuilding @daionics","facets":[]},"location":"San Jose, CA","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/822459120880091136/1722294481","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1818060898277408774/VT6AgE_y_200x200.jpg","joined":"Fri Jan 20 15:01:49 +0000 2017","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individu